HYP-2708 / T941 -- two-far live-depth survival kernel
Exact arithmetic: Fraction wall atoms, imported S64/S47 engines.

LIVE-DEPTH FORMULA CHECK
  h = number of distinct before-missed sectors hit by the two far colors
  dev_t = E_actual[C(t-h)] - E_iid[C(t-h)]
  t=0: K2=       0 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['0', '0', '0'] silent
  t=1: K2=   36/49 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['13/49', '-36/49', '-36/49'] LIVE
  t=2: K2=   47/49 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['2/49', '2/49', '-47/49'] LIVE
  t=3: K2=       1 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['0', '0', '0'] silent
  t=4: K2=       1 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['0', '0', '0'] silent
  t=5: K2=   45/49 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['-45/49', '4/49', '4/49'] LIVE
  t=6: K2=   26/49 coeffs(h0,h1,h2)=['-222/49', '-26/49', '23/49'] LIVE
  conclusion: only t=1,2,5,6 can contribute; t=3,4 are exactly silent.

